<!-- The layout fixture corpus (notes:planning/stages/L-layout/PLAN.md section 6).
     Every fixture is laid out at every left-to-right profile. The
     direction="rtl" profiles lay the root out right to left (HTML's dir
     attribute; GUI.Forms' LayoutDirection) and apply only to the fixtures
     marked bidirectional="true": those whose Chromium boxes differ between
     the two directions. The text-scale="1.5" profiles apply only to
     text fixtures (those with a text-block): Chromium's root font size is
     13 px times the scale, and GUI.Forms' window text scale is the scale.
     Tolerances are logical pixels per box edge, and on a text leaf's first
     baseline (owner decision L-Q9); reference-drift bounds how
     far a regenerated Chromium reference may move from the checked-in one
     (one LayoutUnit, 1/64 px). -->
